      "rationale": "Garen is overperforming in solo queue (52.8% global WR, 6.2% pick rate) while having zero pro presence, so the target is his early/mid lane power and not his late-game teamfight role. There were no community complaints to steer the lever, so we chose the simplest, most legible one: base AD 69 -> 65. This weakens his level 1-6 trades and his Q/E damage in lane (lane trade at L6 -361.8 -> 348.4), but it is a flat value that becomes a much smaller share of his damage once items come in. Sim: soloq_index -0.88% (target -3% to -0.5%), pro_index -0.03% (target >= -0.5%), so pro play is effectively untouched."
